OL,4,CLongest-ever UN climate talks end with 
OL,5,Cno deal as deep divisions exposed      
OL,6,GCountries have failed to reach a major 
OL,7,Gnew deal to tackle climate change      
OL,8,Gafter deep divisions over fossil fuels 
OL,9,Gand money emerged at the UN COP31      
OL,10,Gtalks in Turkey.                       
OL,12,FNegotiations were due to finish on     
OL,13,FFriday but ran late into Sunday in     
OL,14,Fsearch of common ground, becoming the  
OL,15,Flongest UN climate conference in       
OL,16,Fhistory.                               
OL,18,FBut the final deal proved unacceptable 
OL,19,Fto the EU, Pacific island nations and  
OL,20,Fothers because it failed to directly   
OL,21,Fmention fossil fuels, the main cause   
OL,22,Fof global warming.                     
